  <a href="/gallery/wall/all/" class="gallery-product-image" aria-label="Explore the zoomable painting wall"><img src="/gallery-wall/framed-wall.webp" width="1600" height="880" alt="TJ Murphy’s framed paintings arranged on the print wall, shown inside a black frame" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-fit:contain" /></a>
  <div class="product-info ex-slide-caption"><h3><a href="/gallery/wall/all/" class="product-title-link">The Painting Wall</a></h3><p>{tjWall.artworks.length} paintings · An interactive gallery</p><p class="card-buy-row"><span>Move closer and explore →</span></p></div>
</article>

